# Lab 6: IPv6-only services. Compare A and AAAA lookups to see which
# services a scan of only one address family misses. Run:
#   subenum -w examples/labs/words.txt -simulate-zone examples/labs/lab6-ipv6.zone -show-records lab.example
@         A      192.0.2.1
@         AAAA   2001:db8::1
www       A      192.0.2.10
www       AAAA   2001:db8::10
api       AAAA   2001:db8::20
legacy    A      192.0.2.30
